# --- Build output ---
# `build/` is the Makefile's derived data path. `.build/` is nobody's convention here
# — it is SwiftPM's default, and what an ad-hoc `xcodebuild -derivedDataPath .build`
# leaves behind. Once, that was six thousand object files in a commit.
build/
.build/

